{{!-- The mark inside one share control, and nothing else.

	{{> "share-icon" mark="link"}}       copy link
	{{> "share-icon" mark="mail"}}       email
	{{> "share-icon" mark="bluesky"}}    Bluesky
	{{> "share-icon" mark="x"}}          X
	{{> "share-icon" mark="link" size="size-4"}}

	mark   which mark to draw; an unknown name draws nothing rather than a placeholder
	size   size utility for the artwork; each mark carries its own default

Every mark is inline SVG of `currentColor`, so it inherits the button's colour in both Modes and
through the hover transition without a second declaration anywhere — the same reason the header's
search control draws its glass rather than setting a text glyph. No icon font, no sprite, no
request: four marks are smaller than the HTTP round trip that would fetch them.

`aria-hidden` on all four, and no `<title>`: each sits beside its own visible label inside the
same control, so a reader that announced the mark would announce "Email email".

The two generic marks are stroked to the same recipe as the search glass (1.9 at 24 units, round
caps and joins) because they are this theme's drawing. The two service marks are the SERVICES'
own artwork, filled: a brand mark redrawn at a stroke weight that suits us is a brand mark
rendered wrong, and in a share row it is the one thing a reader identifies by shape rather than by
reading it. Both default two pixels smaller than the stroked pair, because a filled glyph reads
heavier at the same box — and Bluesky's box is not square, so its butterfly takes a height and
lets the width follow. --}}
{{#match mark "link"}}
	<svg
		aria-hidden="true"
		viewBox="0 0 24 24"
		fill="none"
		stroke="currentColor"
		stroke-width="1.9"
		stroke-linecap="round"
		class="block {{#if size}}{{size}}{{else}}size-[15px]{{/if}}">
		<path d="M14 7.5h3.25a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 0 9H14"></path>
		<path d="M10 16.5H6.75a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 0-9H10"></path>
		<line x1="8.25" y1="12" x2="15.75" y2="12"></line>
	</svg>
{{/match}}

{{#match mark "mail"}}
	<svg
		aria-hidden="true"
		viewBox="0 0 24 24"
		fill="none"
		stroke="currentColor"
		stroke-width="1.9"
		stroke-linecap="round"
		stroke-linejoin="round"
		class="block {{#if size}}{{size}}{{else}}size-[15px]{{/if}}">
		<rect x="2.75" y="5" width="18.5" height="14" rx="2.25"></rect>
		<path d="m3.5 6.75 8.5 6.25 8.5-6.25"></path>
	</svg>
{{/match}}

{{#match mark "bluesky"}}
	<svg
		aria-hidden="true"
		viewBox="0 0 568 501"
		fill="currentColor"
		class="block w-auto {{#if size}}{{size}}{{else}}h-[13px]{{/if}}">
		<path
			d="M123.121 33.664C188.241 82.553 258.281 181.68 284 234.873c25.719-53.192 95.759-152.32 160.879-201.209C491.866-1.611 568-28.906 568 57.947c0 17.346-9.945 145.713-15.778 166.555-20.275 72.453-94.155 90.933-159.875 79.748C507.222 323.8 536.444 388.62 473.333 453.441c-119.86 123.121-172.272-30.855-185.702-70.276-2.462-7.227-3.614-10.608-3.631-7.733-.017-2.875-1.169.506-3.631 7.733-13.43 39.421-65.842 193.397-185.702 70.276-63.111-64.821-33.89-129.641 80.986-149.191-65.72 11.185-139.6-7.295-159.875-79.748C9.945 203.66 0 75.293 0 57.947 0-28.906 76.135-1.611 123.121 33.664Z"></path>
	</svg>
{{/match}}

{{#match mark "x"}}
	<svg
		aria-hidden="true"
		viewBox="0 0 24 24"
		fill="currentColor"
		class="block {{#if size}}{{size}}{{else}}size-[13px]{{/if}}">
		<path
			d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"></path>
	</svg>
{{/match}}
